PyKorone PostgreSQL migrations.

Use the Makefile's db_revision, db_upgrade, db_downgrade, and db_stamp targets.
Review generated revisions before applying them. Runtime startup applies pending
revisions; importing model modules does not create or migrate tables.

env.py deliberately bootstraps the package namespace without constructing the
Telegram bot. Preserve that boundary when changing model imports or configuration.
Persistence rules: ../.agents/skills/py-korone-development/references/python.md.
Migration workflow: ../.agents/skills/py-korone-development/references/tooling.md.
